WEBVTT

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:13.480
Hinagiku!

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.080
Tell us.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.750
Are we cute?

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.200
Are we cute?

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.520
She really cried!

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.400
Yes, already! You're cute! 
And so what?

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.410
Hey!

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:34.190
Cut that out, underclassmen!

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:36.090
Run for it!

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.290
Of all the...

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:38.510
It happened again?

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.810
Attractiveness Jutsu is still popular?

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.520
It's not being used as ninjutsu anymore,

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.790
but it looks like the underclassmen 
are still doing it for fun.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:51.780
There you go.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:56.020
Those darn kids found out Hinagiku 
cries when they use Attractiveness Jutsu,

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.690
and now they come do it all the time.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.130
That's a pain.

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:03.680
It's because she cries when she ends up 
thinking someone's cuter than her.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:10.600
Hinagiku, don't cry.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.960
But they're all so cute.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:16.840
I guess I'll go give them a warning.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:18.270
Please do, Oniyuri.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:34.510
<i>Hinagiku...</i>

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:37.400
<i>I've got to do something for her!</i>

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.830
<b>Rivals</b>

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:14.170
B-Beni-senpai.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:18.620
Please do some training...

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.220
What are you doing? You're so odd.

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:27.630
I-It's called Attractiveness Jutsu!

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:31.470
You mean that thing nobody 
could ultimately use?

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.910
I heard that Tsubaki can use it.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:37.990
I'm not so sure. Wasn't that 
really just Sensei transformed?

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:42.570
Wh-What's a trap doing in a place like this?

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:45.660
Did you set another trap?

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:47.500
Ahem.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:53.960
So sorry. Setting traps 
is just a habit of mine.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.780
What was that, comedy?

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.090
Nice one!

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:00.880
Was it really?

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:06.510
Would you mind being a test 
subject for my new trap?

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.170
Oh, quit doing that.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:12.810
Um, excuse me! Could you let me down?

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:17.310
Oh, yeah? 
Attractiveness Jutsu does that to Hinagiku?

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:20.690
Yeah, the underclassmen make fun of her.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:25.070
Maybe I'm not actually cute.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.820
She said that, all down in the dumps.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.410
Hinagiku, who's always 
so full of confidence?!

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.580
That's why I'm asking you, Benisumomo!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.840
Go tell her personally that she's cute!

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.010
Huh?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.670
You're Hinagiku's rival, aren't you?

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:48.180
I think she can bounce back 
if a rival compliments her!

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.310
No, she's not my rival in the slightest.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.520
More like, it's annoying how she 
always starts stuff with me.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.760
I still want you to do something!

00:04:58.760 --> 00:04:59.520
Ehh.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.630
Please!

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:04.780
Okay then.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:10.010
The idea of <i>the</i> Hinagiku being 
depressed sounds interesting.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.000
It's worth a look.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.340
H-Hey!

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.700
Th-That isn't what I meant!

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:18.160
What's her deal?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.830
It was a sincere request.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.330
It'll be fine.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:27.510
It might not seem like it, 
but Benisumomo can be kind.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:33.430
That's why I'm sure she'll 
do something for her.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:34.640
Really?

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.680
Sure.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.110
If you say so.

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:39.080
Come on, what's the holdup?

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.190
Oh, sorry! I'll be right there!

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:56.260
Everybody's so cute...

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:59.540
They really are.

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:03.440
Even though I'm not!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:08.130
You really are in a funk.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.590
Benisumomo!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.970
What are you doing here?

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:16.030
I heard you're depressed because 
of all the Attractiveness Jutsu.

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:22.020
<i>Please, Benisumomo! Cheer up Hinagiku!</i>

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.980
So, what are you here to do?

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.060
Hinagiku.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:36.900
Wh-What?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.450
Turn this way.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:46.210
Am I cute?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.300
<i>Benisumomo!</i>

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.800
Yes, you're cute!

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:01.880
It's the first time I've done it, 
but this Attractiveness Jutsu is neat.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.310
Hey! This wasn't what we discussed!

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:05.350
So what?

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:08.260
You mean <i>you</i> brought her, Kibushi?!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:13.600
Well, she was concerned about you...

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.580
Benisumomo was?

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:20.340
Come on! Cheer her up properly!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:21.670
Okay, fine.

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.920
Hinagiku, listen.

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:42.290
Aren't you the next cutest, after me?

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.830
She's cute!

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:47.190
Hey! What is with you?!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:50.210
Stop that!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:50.210
You're cute!

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:53.610
After all, I'm nothing but...

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.080
I'm nothing but...!

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.080
Hinagiku!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.620
What's got you so down, anyway?

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.620
I said stop!

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:10.340
I want to cheer you up, Hinagiku!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:14.240
What's it going to take to make you cheerful?

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.640
<i>M-Mizubashou...!</i>

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:23.890
<i>It might not seem like it, 
but Benisumomo can be kind.</i>

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:32.070
I... am... worthless.

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:33.660
Hinagiku!

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.360
Okay, I'm leaving.

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:37.770
Go! Get lost!

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.530
Sorry, Hinagiku!

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.760
It's all because I asked <i>her</i> to come.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:47.290
Hinagiku, I'm sorry.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.230
Pull yourself together!

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:51.440
<i>Hinagiku, turn this way.</i>

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.380
Am I cute?

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:59.560
Aren't you the next cutest, after me?

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.760
What the heck was that?

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:03.720
Huh?

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:07.690
She never usually takes any notice of me.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:11.260
<i>What's got you so down, anyway?</i>

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:15.480
<i>I want to cheer you up, Hinagiku.</i>

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.830
Hinagiku?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.770
Maybe she was...

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.940
<i>I took that way too far.</i>

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:45.840
<i>I was just going to play around once 
or twice, then cheer her up right.</i>

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:51.770
<i>But it was too much fun seeing
flippant Hinagiku so off her game.</i>

00:09:57.930 --> 00:09:59.230
<i>I could go back and...</i>

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.620
Hinagiku...

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:09.590
Benisumomo.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:20.130
I had no idea you were so afraid of me!

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:22.510
Hinagiku!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:25.430
Huh?

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:30.050
I already knew you thought of me as a rival,

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:34.730
but I never thought you'd seize the chance 
to come crush me when I was down!

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:39.350
But now that I realize that, 
I simply can't let you beat me.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:38.540
Mhm! Mhm! Mhm!

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:46.320
Because in the end, 
I'm your much-feared rival!

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:50.010
That's more like it! 
That's the Hinagiku I know!

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:53.800
And naturally, I won't lose to 
you when it comes to cuteness!

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:57.330
Right, right! Hinagiku is the cutest!

00:10:58.520 --> 00:10:59.720
Well, well.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:04.530
Good ol' Hinagiku, positive as ever.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:06.100
Oh.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.980
I went and caught them...

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.820
Stop that!

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.210
What in the world's going on here?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.700
There you go again!

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.970
She only just got back on her feet!

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:28.950
Stop doing that, I tell you!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.540
<b>Picture of a Man</b>

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:33.750
Ahh, Sazanka and Asagao?

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:37.170
I'm having them tidy up and 
clean the east document storage.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.840
It's punishment for the foolish 
thing they did in class.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.880
Wh-What kind of foolish thing?

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.650
I don't even want to say it.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:53.240
I wondered what was keeping those two.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:55.060
What could they have done?

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:59.240
Anyway, let's help out 
and get it over with quickly.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:11:59.970
Yeah.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:09.540
<i>I'm alone with Rindou.</i>

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:13.260
<i>Maybe this is my chance!</i>

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:15.860
Uh, Rindou?

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:20.000
Would you mind telling me about men?

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.360
About men?

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:22.720
Right, right!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:25.140
Please teach me something about them!

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.100
Let's continue from the other day!

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:32.440
Let's see. I've already told 
you practically everything.

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:34.290
I'm not sure if there's anything else.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:38.060
Oh! Th-Then... 
Hey, how about a picture of a man?!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:39.650
A picture?

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:43.120
Good idea! Drawing is my thing!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.340
I'm on it!

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.360
R-Really?!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:52.160
<i>Finally, I'll get to see my heart's desire!</i>

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:55.750
<i>What a man looks like!</i>

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.640
I'm done!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.340
<i>"Gulp..."</i>

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:08.630
Here.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:23.400
Wh-What... is this?

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.530
A man.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.280
I'm proud of it, too.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:35.280
Th-Thank you very much...

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.520
You're welcome.

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:44.130
Oh! Rindou and Tsubaki-chan!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:44.130
<b>Nice and Tidy</b>

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.740
Have you come to help us?!

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:49.870
What did you manage to do this time?

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.010
Well...

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:54.860
You know, it's a long story.

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:56.960
Wait, I'd just as soon not know.

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.340
Now, let's hurry and straighten this up.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.740
Aww, I wanna tell you!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.740
<i>I'd never have guessed 
Rindou's such a bad artist.</i>

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:14.380
<i>Bad?</i>

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:18.120
<i>No, I have no way of knowing that.</i>

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:21.170
<i>I've never seen a man.</i>

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:26.130
<i>What if... that... really was one?!</i>

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:31.860
<i>No, no, no! It can't be! Never!</i>

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:33.010
<i>There's no chance that could—</i>

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:35.990
Nee-sama?!

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:36.980
Tsubaki-chan?!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.120
Are you okay?

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:42.110
Y-Yes. I think.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.600
Ow...

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:54.180
What? You're having them 
clean up document storage?

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:54.970
Yes.

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:57.910
Well, there's nothing in 
there they shouldn't see.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.910
That's true.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:04.150
It was in need of cleaning soon, 
so the timing seemed ideal.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:11.280
Huh?

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:14.550
<b>Man</b>

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.480
You don't suppose...

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:18.260
There's a drawing of a man in here?!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.580
Let's look at it, Nee-sama!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.440
Let's find out for sure!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.570
Of course we can't do that!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.550
I'm going to go hand this over to Sensei!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.160
A peek won't hurt.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:32.320
No way!

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:37.580
Or so you say, but don't 
you want to see it, too?

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.910
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.640
You're a little too much of a model student.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.540
That's right!

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:48.120
For instance, if your hand 
slips, and you see inside,

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.940
that's what you'd call an accident.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.340
Accidents can't be helped!

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.270
<b>Man</b>

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:06.480
Forget it! I'm going 
straight to Sensei, and—

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:07.770
Shoomp!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.460
We won't let you go!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.280
Do you think the two of you can stop me?

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:15.610
We can!

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:18.410
We have a new Jutsu that 
got us in trouble today.

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:22.440
You know, I don't think even 
<i>you</i> can beat it, Tsubaki-chan.

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:23.330
<i>That's the "foolish thing" 
Konoha-sensei mentioned.</i>

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.940
Okay, here goes!

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.350
I don't think you can do it.

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:30.260
When did this happen?!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.680
So, I'll be back.

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.120
Please, at least, let us do the Jutsu!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:36.220
We were saving it for last!

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:35.950
Take care.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.430
<i>I swear.</i>

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.940
<i>Those two only work together 
when they're up to no good.</i>

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:56.780
<i>M-Maybe I'll look anyway.</i>

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.040
<i>No, no! Don't do that!</i>

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:02.460
<i>I must have a firm sense of 
responsibility, as team leader!</i>

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:08.130
<i>Inside here, there's a man!</i>

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:12.520
For instance, if your hand 
slips, and you see inside,

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:15.240
that's what you'd call an accident.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:17.890
Accidents can't be helped!

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:22.340
<i>If my hand slips, it's an accident.</i>

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:27.570
<i>An accident!</i>

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:30.110
<i>That's just no good!</i>

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:33.280
<i>I can't forbid them 
and then go look for myself!</i>

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:38.530
<i>Because I saw that picture Rindou drew,</i>

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.560
<i>my urge to make sure nearly 
got the better of me.</i>

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:42.580
Tsubaki.

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.380
You found it, and were bringing it to me?

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:02.410
Tsubaki?

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:04.380
Hey.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:06.440
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:08.850
You did well. See you later.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.180
Th-That was...

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.120
Welcome back.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.060
You took off suddenly.

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:27.170
Was there something in storage 
you didn't want seen?

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:29.550
It's nothing. Just something from the past.

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:33.210
Would you bother to go get 
something that's nothing?

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:38.090
Is it embarrassing, perhaps?

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.120
Embarrassing, huh?

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:28.550
Sure, I'd say it's embarrassing.

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:29.990
Show it to me.

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:30.890
No.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:33.770
Oh, where's the harm?

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:37.180
Welcome back, Nee-sama!

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:39.440
Tsubaki-chan, that was quick!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.610
We're done here, for the most part.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.220
Sorry to leave you with it.

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:47.450
Hey, did you really give back that scroll?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.720
Yes, I gave it straight to Hana-sensei.

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:54.440
But it was such a discovery!

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:56.680
So, did you see inside it?

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:58.800
Huh? You saw it?

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.930
What did he look like?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.510
I-I didn't see it.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:07.920
Really?

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:10.040
I-I really didn't see it!

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:14.980
Oh, well, poo. You're so upstanding.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:19.060
Come on, you two. Let's hurry 
and finish up the cleaning.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:21.860
All that's left is to sweep the floor.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:25.220
Then I'll handle the dustpan! 
You gather it up, Sazanka.

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:26.080
Sure, sure.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:28.280
But, Asagao, later we do 
some serious training.

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:31.330
Nice! Secret serious training!

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:35.720
<i>The contents of the scroll were 
the same as Rindou's drawing.</i>

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:38.650
<i>Is that what men look like, after all?</i>

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:42.340
<i>No, that can't be!</i>

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.440
It could never be!

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:47.460
What could never be, Nee-sama?

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:50.030
N-Never you mind!

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:51.560
Now, let's get to cleaning!

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.680
Clean, clean!

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:53.920
All right!

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:28.910
<b>Akane Class</b>

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:31.660
And so, Konoha and I will be 
away for two to three days.

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:34.540
Tsubaki, look after the 
village during that time.

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:36.830
Yes, ma'am. Leave it to me.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:40.700
Well, nothing big has ever happened,

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:42.730
and I doubt anything will then.

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:46.050
Yes, everyone should just 
do what they normally...

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:47.630
do?!

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:51.150
Please don't get up.

00:22:51.150 --> 00:22:54.850
Well, we're just going so that 
Hana-sensei can see a doctor.

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:56.390
We'll come home as soon as that's done.

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:02.200
Don't let the other students 
know I'm having back problems.

00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:03.750
R-Right, ma'am.

00:23:03.750 --> 00:23:06.180
<i>They've all known for some time, though.</i>

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:10.650
So. We're counting on you, Tsubaki.

00:23:10.650 --> 00:23:11.160
Yes, ma'am!

00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:14.580
Kunoichi Tsubaki of Akane Class

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:19.030
will take responsibility for the 
village's safety while you're away!

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next time:
